<div class="space-y-gutter pb-12">
  <nav class="mb-8">
    <a href="<%= category_path(@category.slug) %>" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-fixed flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors font-body-md text-body-md">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">arrow_back</span>
      Volver a <%= @category.name %>
    </a>
  </nav>

  <header class="mb-12">
    <span class="font-label-mono text-label-mono text-primary bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary/20 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 inline-block"><%= @category.name %></span>
    <h1 class="font-display-lg-mobile md:font-display-lg text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg text-on-surface font-bold mb-4"><%= @subcategory.name %></h1>
    <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-primary-container rounded-full"></div>
  </header>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
    <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-8">
      <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-8 text-center">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-primary-container/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary">auto_stories</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-bold mb-4">Contenido de <%= @subcategory.name %></h2>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-lg mx-auto mb-6">Estamos preparando artículos y lecturas exclusivas para esta categoría. Vuelve pronto para descubrir contenido espiritual único.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-gold-mystic animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="font-label-mono text-label-mono text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Nuevo contenido próximamente</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-8">
      <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold border-b border-white/10 pb-4 mb-4">Subcategorías</h3>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <% @category.subcategories.each do |sub| %>
            <a href="<%= subcategory_path(@category.slug, sub.slug) %>" class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-surface-container-low/50 transition-all <%= 'bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20' if sub.id == @subcategory.id %>">
              <span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface"><%= sub.name %></span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant">chevron_right</span>
            </a>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl p-1 relative overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-gold-mystic to-primary opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-high relative z-10 h-full rounded-lg p-6 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[48px] text-gold-mystic mb-4">workspace_premium</span>
          <h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-bold mb-2">Obtén una Lectura Personalizada</h4>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-6">La IA ha analizado tu energía. Descubre lo que el universo tiene preparado para ti en esta área de tu vida.</p>
          <button class="w-full bg-gold-mystic text-on-tertiary-fixed font-body-md text-body-md font-bold py-3 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all">Leer mi energía</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
